quran[7]{c,v,t}:
  29,39,"And (remember) Qarun (Korah), Pharaoh and Haman. Indeed, Musa (Moses) came to them with clear proofs, but they behaved arrogantly in the land, yet they could not outstrip (Us)."
  29,40,"So We seized each (of them) for his sin. Among them were those upon whom We sent a violent pebble storm. And among them were those whom the sudden roaring blast overtook. And among them were those whom We caused the earth to swallow. And among them were those whom We drowned. It was not Allah who wronged them, but it was they who used to wrong themselves."
  29,41,"The example of those who adopt protectors besides Allah is like the spider that makes a house (for itself). And indeed, the weakest of all houses is the spider’s house, if only they knew!"
  29,42,"Allah indeed knows what they worship besides Him. And He is the All-Mighty, the All-Wise."
  29,43,"And these are the parables; We draw them for people, but none understands them except the people of knowledge."
  29,44,Allah created the heavens and the earth for a true purpose. There is indeed a sign in this for the believers.
  29,45,"(Esteemed Prophet!) Recite what has been revealed to you of the Book and establish the prayer. Indeed, prayer prevents indecencies and wrongs. And the remembrance of Allah is (even) greater. And Allah knows whatever (deeds) you perform."
